IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FIGURATIVE-CONSTANTS.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-NUM-VAR   PIC 9(5) VALUE ZEROS.
01 WS-ALPHA-VAR PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-NUM-VAR2  PIC 9(5) USAGE COMP VALUE ZEROS.
01 WS-ALPHA-VAR2 PIC X(10) USAGE DISPLAY VALUE SPACES.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE ZEROS TO WS-NUM-VAR.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-ALPHA-VAR.
    DISPLAY WS-NUM-VAR.
    DISPLAY WS-ALPHA-VAR.
    DISPLAY ZEROS.
    DISPLAY SPACES.
    STOP RUN.